{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up or Down?</strong> is a dark choice-driven visual novel in which you choose which guests will be evacuated from the Deluxe Resort. Talk to them, search them, and if they prove suspicious, be sure to do what you must, bellhop! Will you manage to evacuate only healthy guests, or will you end up contaminating everyone else?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Remember to greet the guests!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and greet the colorful guests of Deluxe Resort, one encounter at a time. Interrogate them and decide whether they will join you in the elevator. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don't allow any sick inside!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the news. Remember the symptoms. Some guests will seem restless, others will try to fool you. Don't let them. Search them instead. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill one to save them all!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sick will kill if not identified in time. Do not hesitate to eliminate those guests who raise suspicion. Don't kill any innocent. Lives are at stake here, bellhop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up or Down?</strong> features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Impactful choices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 different outcomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3533080?t=1743179621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743179621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/9ab530416020a1eaf88c629cf6683bbd3d02159e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743179621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/9ab530416020a1eaf88c629cf6683bbd3d02159e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=174317962